1 NF - No repeating groups - no repeating values in same row
2 NF - Split into separate tables,  All non-key columns should depend on the entire primary key.
3 NF - Move reference data to a new table -  A column should depend only on the primary key, not another column.

View - virtual table based on the result of a SQL query. It does not store data but dynamically retrieves results whenever queried.
materialized view- it will store the data, Precomputes and stores query results for faster performance.

DROP - it will remove data & delete table structure.
TRUNCATE - Just clear all data but keep the table structure- faster than delete as it doesn't filter records.


