SCD types
SCD 0 - No Changes Allowed- Immutable data (ex: Product IDs)
SCD 1	- Overwrite Data (No History) (ex: phone number update)
SCD 2	- Maintain Full History using versioning or timestamps	Tracking historical changes (ex: address changes)
SCD 3	- Limited History (Previous Value Column)(ex: last 2 addresses)
